["A casualty removes only its own preset", ([_town] call OT_fnc_townGarrisonRoster) isEqualTo [["Police",2],[_preset,1]]] call _check;
[_victim, _actor] call OT_fnc_deathHandler;
["Duplicate death processing does not subtract twice", ([_town] call OT_fnc_townGarrisonRoster) isEqualTo [["Police",2],[_preset,1]]] call _check;
